WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-CA

00:00:02.008 --> 00:00:05.380
I don’t think anyone buys insurance
thinking that they’re going to need it.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.738
And nothing was ever
going to happen to me.

00:00:07.763 --> 00:00:08.887
But, it did.

00:00:08.912 --> 00:00:13.847
And I was very, very grateful that
we had this particular product.

00:00:13.872 --> 00:00:19.251
A few years ago, my husband and I
decided to take on an old house

00:00:19.276 --> 00:00:20.943
and renovate it top to bottom

00:00:20.968 --> 00:00:22.689
Just two years later,

00:00:22.714 --> 00:00:24.483
I was diagnosed with cancer.

00:00:24.508 --> 00:00:28.863
My husband and my kids, if they had
to worry about money on top of that,

00:00:28.888 --> 00:00:31.159
it just, that would have
been really devastating.

00:00:31.184 --> 00:00:35.418
Manulife just took essentially the
biggest bill we have in our life

00:00:35.443 --> 00:00:36.668
and took care of it.

00:00:36.922 --> 00:00:42.095
Having this product just meant
the world and I think it contributed

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.643
to me getting through all
the really tough treatments

00:00:45.668 --> 00:00:47.429
that I had to get through.

00:00:47.454 --> 00:00:49.515
You never know what’s
going to happen to you.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:52.468
The better prepared you are,
the better you can face

00:00:52.493 --> 00:00:53.873
whatever comes your way.

